## **1. System Overview**

Cashify Pro is an enterprise-grade Reverse Supply Chain and Device Refurbishment Platform built using a microservices architecture. The system orchestrates the complete lifecycle of pre-owned devices - from customer sell-quote to warehouse intake, diagnostics, grading, repair, quality control, inventory management, and multi-channel resale.

The platform consists of multiple independent backend services developed using Laravel 12, and a comprehensive Frontend application suite (Customer Portal, Technician Dashboard, Admin Panel, Warehouse Management) developed using React. Each backend service is responsible for a specific business capability and communicates with other services using REST APIs and asynchronous messaging.

